extends base

mixin team(img, lname, fname, role)
    .col-12.col-sm-6.col-md-4.col-lg-3.text-center
        .team-img
            img.w-75.h-75.fade-in.border.rounded-circle.border-secondary(src=`${img}` style="object-fit: cover;")
        .team-intro.py-4 
            h6.text-gray.display-5.fs-5 #{lname}
                br 
                | #{fname} 
            p.text-primary 
                b #{role} 

block content

    //  Page Header Start 
    .container-fluid.team__page-header.page__header
        h1.display-5.text-primary.mb-3.about-text The Team 
            i.fa.fa-users.fa-2x.text-primary.mb-4
        .d-inline-flex.text-primary.fade-out
            h6.m-0
                a.text-white(href="/") Home &gt;&gt;
                h6.text-white.m-0.px-3 /
            h6.text-primary.m-0 Team
    //  Page Header Start 
    .container.pt-5.pb-3
        .animate-from-down
            h1.display-5.mb-4.ps-2.py-2(style="border-left: 6px solid #f4d73c") Meet the  
                span.text-primary Team

    .container.management
        .row.g-5
            .col-lg-4.col-md-6.mx-auto.animate-from-down
                .row.g-0
                    .col-12(style="min-height: 300px;")
                        .flip-card
                            .flip__card-inner
                                .flip__card-front
                                    img.w-100.h-100(src="/img/IMG-20250716-WA0071.jpg", style="object-fit: cover;")
                                .flip__card-back.p-3 
                                    h4.text-white Dr Benson Igboejesi
                                    p.text-small.text-white(style='font-size: 1rem') CEO & OWNER
                                    p(style='font-size: 0.7rem') Holds first class B.Com, and M.Com, degrees in Accounting & Auditing, and a Ph.D. in Finance & Banking – all from the University of Pune, India. The degrees were obtained in 1985, 1988 and 1991 respectively. Among other brilliant qualifications and training, he has a Diploma in computer applications. He was a recipient of the Commonwealth Scholarship for his Ph.D. degree program.

                                    p(style='font-size: 0.7rem') After his National Youth Service in April 1993, he immediately took up appointment as a Credit Officer in the former ABC Merchant Bank Limited, where he rose to Head the departments of Administration/Human Resources/Corporate Planning. In February 1998, he moved his career to one of the major indigenous oil & gas companies – Baywood Continental Limited as Manager Finance & Administration. 
                                        br 
                                        | In May 2000, he was assigned more challenging responsibilities to co-ordinate all branch finance and admin functions, and in August 1, 2002 he was elevated to the position of AGM - Assistant General Manager - Finance/Accounts/Administration.
                                    p.text-small.text-white(style='font-size: 1rem') PROJECT EXPERIENCE
                                    p(style='font-size: 0.7rem')

                    .col-12
                        .bg-light.p-4
                            h4.text-uppercase.sub-title dr benson igboejesi
                            span.text-gray CEO &amp; Founder

            .col-lg-4.col-md-6.mx-auto.animate-from-down
                .row.g-0
                    .col-12(style="min-height: 300px;")
                        .flip-card
                            .flip__card-inner
                                .flip__card-front
                                    img.w-100.h-100(src="/img/IMG-20250716-WA0072.jpg", style="object-fit: cover;")
                                .flip__card-back This is Igboejesi prince

                    .col-12
                        .bg-light.p-4
                            h4.text-uppercase.sub-title igboejesi prince
                            span.text-gray Project Manager 

            .col-lg-4.col-md-6.mx-auto.animate-from-down
                .row.g-0
                    .col-12(style="min-height: 300px;")
                        .flip-card
                            .flip__card-inner
                                .flip__card-front
                                    img.w-100.h-100(src="/img/IMG-20250716-WA0073.jpg", style="object-fit: cover;")
                                .flip__card-back This is Ewa joseph

                    .col-12
                        .bg-light.p-4
